/*
 * The artifacts in the compliance documentation pack. Filled in by the
 * content author; the service and the pages read it. Keep ids stable: they
 * appear in URLs, in the audit trail and in the admin's publish list.
 *
 * File paths are relative to compliance/ at the repository root. The
 * control matrix files and the manifest file are generated by the service
 * at request time from src/data/compliance/controls.ts and this file; the
 * licensing portal's own SBOM is written at build time to
 * compliance/sbom/generated/ens-products-page.spdx.json.
 */

